    modal(`${modalTitle('Convert an older Room Creator project')}<p>v0.4 adds actual wall openings and viewpoint-owned cover. Your original file is not modified.</p><ul><li>The existing room becomes the first floor section.</li><li>Object and viewpoint positions are retained where valid.</li><li>Known legacy door/window sprites become wall-mounted openings; review their placement.</li><li>Existing valid pairs are adopted by their primary covered viewpoint. Object-follow behavior is replaced with viewpoint ownership.</li><li>Older routes remain, but wall-blocked routes are flagged during testing.</li></ul><label class="check"><input id="architectureOnly" type="checkbox">Start fresh with architecture and viewpoints only · remove old images and objects</label><p>Unchecked: keep images from this file. Checked: the new image library is empty and any object-based cover must be reassigned. Existing unsaved edits will be replaced.</p><div class="button-row"><button data-action="close-modal">Cancel</button><button id="convertProject" class="primary">Convert and review</button></div>`);
